(Step-by-Step Logic:) Tj
50 561.0 Td
(  1. Each pass bubbles the largest unsorted element to its final position.) Tj
50 548.0 Td
(  2. Compare every adjacent pair from left to right.) Tj
50 535.0 Td
(  3. Swap if left > right \(out of order\).) Tj
50 522.0 Td
(  4. If no swaps in a full pass => array is already sorted => stop early.) Tj
50 509.0 Td
(  5. Worst case: n-1 passes needed.) Tj
50 496.0 Td
() Tj
50 483.0 Td
(Complexity:) Tj
50 470.0 Td
(  Best Case  : O\(n\)  -- already sorted, one pass, zero swaps, early exit) Tj
50 457.0 Td
(  Worst Case : O\(n^2\) -- reverse sorted) Tj
50 444.0 Td
(  Average    : O\(n^2\)) Tj
50 431.0 Td
(  Space      : O\(1\) in-place) Tj
50 418.0 Td
